  <resources uuid="895aea8f-4c4e-44e5-b720-0a2e683191b3">
    <name>IsVerificationRequired</name>
    <synonym>
      <key>en</key>
      <value>Verification required</value>
    </synonym>
    <synonym>
      <key>fa</key>
      <value>تأیید اعتبار لازم است</value>
    </synonym>
    <synonym>
      <key>it</key>
      <value>Требуется проверка</value>
    </synonym>
    <synonym>
      <key>ru</key>
      <value>Требуется проверка</value>
    </synonym>
    <synonym>
      <key>tr</key>
      <value>Doğrulama gerekli</value>
    </synonym>
    <synonym>
      <key>vi</key>
      <value>Cần kiểm tra</value>
    </synonym>
    <synonym>
      <key>pl</key>
      <value>Verification required</value>
    </synonym>
    <type>
      <types>Boolean</types>
    </type>
    <toolTip>
      <key>en</key>
      <value>Cannot verify the signature due to external circumstances (no cryptographic service provider, no up-to-date revocation list, and so on)</value>
    </toolTip>
    <toolTip>
      <key>fa</key>
      <value>به دلیل شرایط خارجی امکان تأیید امضا وجود ندارد (عدم وجود ارائه‌دهنده سرویس رمزنگاری، عدم وجود فهرست ابطال به‌روز و غیره)</value>
    </toolTip>
    <toolTip>
      <key>ru</key>
      <value>Не удалось проверить подпись из-за внешних обстоятельств (нет криптопровайдера, актуального списка отзыва и т.п.)</value>
    </toolTip>
    <toolTip>
      <key>tr</key>
      <value>İmza, dış koşullar nedeniyle doğrulanamadı (kripto sağlayıcının, güncel geri bildirim listesinin olmaması vb.)</value>
    </toolTip>
    <toolTip>
      <key>vi</key>
      <value>Không thể xác minh chữ ký do các trường hợp bên ngoài (không có nhà cung cấp mã hóa, không có danh sách thu hồi hiện tại, v.v.)</value>
    </toolTip>
    <toolTip>
      <key>it</key>
      <value>Cannot verify the signature due to external circumstances (no cryptographic service provider, no up-to-date revocation list, and so on)</value>
    </toolTip>
    <toolTip>
      <key>pl</key>
      <value>Cannot verify the signature due to external circumstances (no cryptographic service provider, no up-to-date revocation list, and so on)</value>
    </toolTip>
    <minValue xsi:type="core:UndefinedValue"/>
    <maxValue xsi:type="core:UndefinedValue"/>
    <fullTextSearch>Use</fullTextSearch>
    <dataHistory>Use</dataHistory>
    <fillValue xsi:type="core:UndefinedValue"/>
  </resources>
